WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.400
New to making music? On the first start, choose I'm new to making music.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.800
LYNX starts a short tour that builds one real song, step by step.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.600
Step one: a beat. Do it for me adds drums with a starter beat.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.600
Step two: the song's key. The chords and loops will follow it.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.400
Step three: an instrument, here keys you can play at once.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:37.200
Step four: chords, from the Chord pad or notes in the Editor.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:43.400
Step five: a voice or a loop. Here a bass loop, then Next.

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:49.200
Step six: an effect with one knob, such as Room or Echo.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:55.000
Step seven: Finish gives the whole song its sound.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:01:01.200
Your first song is done. Save it as a file, or open a demo song.
